            "review_title": "Review at Yoyo Beer Garden Hồ Con Rùa",
            "review_text": "Lucille B\n2 contributions\n0\nDisorganized, Slow, and Rude—Go Next Door Instead\nFeb 2025 • Family\nUnfortunately, I wouldn’t recommend this place. Despite being the only customers there, service was incredibly slow, and when our order finally arrived, the staff was dismissive and rude. The whole place felt messy and disorganized. Definitely not worth the wait when there are much better bars nearby—especially the one right next door, which had a much better atmosphere and service.\nRead more\nWritten February 23, 2025",
